    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583460/extras/b8bbb7cef8158ba1f0591b135dde750a.avif?t=1719412310\" width=500 height=102 /></span><br><br>CubeOS is a logic turn-based puzzle game, you play as a High-Tech Cube, the goal of whom is to complete the level at all costs. The motivation for the hero will be added later! (UPD: Motivation has been added!)<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 90 levels<br></li><li>A variety of enemies<br></li><li>10 types of interactive items<br></li><li>Challenges along the way<br></li><li>Portals (!!!)<br></li><li>Simple levels<br></li><li>Terribly difficult levels<br></li><li>Plot<br></li><li>Cute Sci-fi style<br></li><li>Steam Achievements<br></li><li>Steam Cloud</li></ul>",
